# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logger — BuildLoggerFromEnv (requires jardisadapter/logger)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Delivered inactive: LOG_HANDLERS unset keeps the logger null. Comma-separated
# handler list, each entry handler[:LEVEL] with LOG_LEVEL as the fallback.
# Handlers: file, console, errorlog, syslog, browserconsole, null; redis needs
# .env.redis; slack/teams/loki/webhook need their URL key below.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

#LOG_HANDLERS=console:DEBUG,file:ERROR
#LOG_LEVEL=INFO
#LOG_CONTEXT=app
#LOG_FILE_PATH=/app/var/log/app.log

# URL-driven handlers — only read when the handler is listed above.
#LOG_SLACK_URL=
#LOG_TEAMS_URL=
#LOG_LOKI_URL=
#LOG_WEBHOOK_URL=
